# impeccable design skills — payload is ~3.2MB per harness, so it stays out of git.
# Set up locally with: npx impeccable install
# The hooks in .claude/settings.json and .cursor/hooks.json ARE tracked; both are
# guarded, so they no-op for anyone who hasn't run the installer.
.claude/skills/impeccable/
.cursor/skills/impeccable/
.cursor/agents/impeccable-*.md


